stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Submitted: POST /api/requests
  Submitted --> UnderReview: Access request and manager resolved (on submit or retry-routing)
  UnderReview --> Approved: Manager approves
  UnderReview --> Rejected: Manager rejects
  Approved --> Fulfilled: ItAdmin fulfils
  Fulfilled --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  note right of Submitted
    Service requests stay Submitted (open question).
    Access requests stay Submitted when the manager
    cannot be resolved, until IT retries routing.
  end note
